   "section": null,
   "captions": [
    {
     "start": 73.3,
     "end": 76.1,
     "text": "There are times that I don't feel like living."
    },
    {
     "start": 76.2,
     "end": 78.5,
     "text": "Or I feel cold."
    },
    {
     "start": 78.6,
     "end": 81.2,
     "text": "Parang nanglalamig ako sa Lord."
    },
    {
     "start": 81.3,
     "end": 83.3,
     "text": "But what's good there is,"
    },
    {
     "start": 83.3,
     "end": 86.8,
     "text": "pag nalalayo tayo sa Lord at nawawala yung flame natin,"
    },
    {
     "start": 86.9,
     "end": 91.7,
     "text": "the solution is to draw the people who have that fire."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "clip": "0228",
   "at": 91.8,
   "dur": 10.4,
   "kind": "t",
   "section": null,
   "captions": [
    {
     "start": 92.0,
     "end": 94.4,
     "text": "As we're looking at the fire,"
    },
    {
     "start": 94.4,
     "end": 97.5,
     "text": "let's be reminded that it is the Holy Spirit living inside of us,"
    },
    {
     "start": 97.5,
     "end": 102.1,
     "text": "and that we get to be a fire to each and every one of us."
    }
   ]
